{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/71cac523a94c8e4bb03602cd9268f0db.avif?t=1741698341\" width=320 height=100 /></span><br>\ud83e\udea9<strong>Your main task is to identify who can enter the club and who can't. Guests will line up, and you must decide if they are allowed in based on certain criteria. Some guests might try to sneak in with prohibited items, and it's up to you to find these hidden objects. Use a range of tools, like metal detectors and scanners, to inspect the guests and uncover anything suspicious.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/0e354ee0036015118e7a519fe972a4b0.poster.avif?t=1741698341\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/0e354ee0036015118e7a519fe972a4b0.webm?t=1741698341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/0e354ee0036015118e7a519fe972a4b0.mp4?t=1741698341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/a625269aeedb7833933de594525f2298.avif?t=1741698341\" width=320 height=100 /></span><br>\ud83e\udea9<strong>Clean the visitors, remove tattoos and splash water!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/0714f2943f5f6f14462f55ea61ec5a37.poster.avif?t=1741698341\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068720/extras/0714f2943f5f6f14462f55ea61ec5a37.webm?t=1741698341\" typ